# PR Link In Every Message

Once a pull request is opened in the current session, include a clickable Markdown link to that PR in every subsequent assistant message.

- Required format: `PR: [#<number>](https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/pull/<number>)`
- If multiple PRs exist, include the most recently opened active PR.
- Keep the PR link present even in short status updates and acknowledgements.
